SUMMARY:Chef Collaboration Omakase featuring Jamie Davis of The Hackney at Dashi in Downtown Durham
DESCRIPTION:For our July omakase\, Dashi is welcoming Chef Jamie Davis of The Hackney in Washington\, NC for a special five-course collaboration dinner. \nA 2024 James Beard Finalist for Best Chef: Southeast and Executive Chef of The Hackney\, Chef Jamie brings a thoughtful\, Southern eclectic approach to seafood\, drawing from the French\, Spanish\, African\, Native American\, and English traditions that have shaped Southern foodways. Together\, our teams are creating a cohesive menu that blends the culinary identities of The Hackney and Dashi into one unforgettable evening! \nTo learn more about Chef Jamie and The Hackney\, follow @carolinachef and @thehackneywashingtonnc. \nReservations available at our Downtown Durham izakaya at www.dashiramen.com/omakase.\n$65 five course dinner + $35 pairings \nJapanese Restaurant in Durham\, NC | Downtown Durham Restaurant | Craft Cocktails | Date Night
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/chef-collaboration-omakase-featuring-jamie-davis-of-the-hackney-at-dashi-in-downtown-durham/
LOCATION:Dashi\, 415 E Chapel Hill St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Date Night,Food & Drink,Wines, Spirits, Beer and Cheer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/07-July-Chef-Collaboration-Omakase_Horizontal-1.jpg
GEO:35.9970933;-78.8992279
